    "body": "Create one new GitHub Pages build identity after explicitly cancelling the stale Stage 7.13 deployment versions through the official Pages cancellation endpoint.\n\nContext:\n- Stage 7.13 runtime PR #303 remains authoritative at `69a1137c6ab4ede2a0d1e420cde477f29b0b2949`\n- recovery PR #305 moved the cache marker to `stage7_13_aftermath_dm_followup_20260806b` at current `main@c26f29ab42c9215c2c9f2ee05278b8ba0946d036`\n- Pages attempts for build versions `69a1137c...` and `c26f29ab...` remained queued until timeout and were cancelled\n- temporary cancellation workflow `31106445239` called the official Pages cancel endpoint and received HTTP 204 for both build versions\n- redeploying the already-cancelled `c26f29ab...` version immediately returned `Deployment cancelled`, so a genuinely new commit SHA is required\n\nChange:\n- bump only `stage7_13_aftermath_dm_followup_20260806b` to `stage7_13_aftermath_dm_followup_20260806c`\n- modify exactly `AsyncScene/Web/index.html` and `docs/index.html`\n- keep both index mirrors byte-identical\n- create a fresh Pages build version after explicit backend cancellation\n\nValidation:\n- workflow `31106694752` PASS\n- exact final two-file diff\n- two additions and two deletions per mirror\n- branch `behind_by 0`\n- no JavaScript, CSS, gameplay, state, battle, DM, economy, settlement, conflict API, argument canon, or repository-memory changes\n- temporary workflow removed before PR creation",
